    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esca is an immersive survival RPG that invites you to step into the role of a small repair robot maintaining a deteriorating underwater research station. As you face daily challenges of repairing vital systems and scavenging for resources, you'll be forced to make tough decisions that could impact the station's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets about your past and the true nature of the mission as you navigate through the station. Will you choose to preserve the station at any cost, or will you risk everything to unravel the mysteries beneath the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple paths and outcomes, every choice you make will shape the course of your journey. Each playthrough offers new challenges and fresh perspectives, providing a unique experience every time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esca is an immersive survival RPG that invites you to step into the role of a small repair robot maintaining a deteriorating underwater research station. As you face daily challenges of repairing vital systems and scavenging for resources, you'll be forced to make tough decisions that could impact the station's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets about your past and the true nature of the mission as you navigate through the station. Will you choose to preserve the station at any cost, or will you risk everything to unravel the mysteries beneath the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple paths and outcomes, every choice you make will shape the course of your journey. Each playthrough offers new challenges and fresh perspectives, providing a unique experience every time.</p>",
